1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:09,255
When one area gets crowded, each person needs more space.
当局部区域拥挤时，每个人都需要更大的空间。

2
00:00:09,255 --> 00:00:16,162
The next seating pass sees those larger footprints.
下一轮排座会看到这些更大的占地。

3
00:00:16,162 --> 00:00:23,070
Cell inflation adds the same feedback to placement.
单元膨胀把同样的反馈加入布局。

4
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:32,536
A 12 by 8 chip is divided into a 4 by 2 GCell grid.
12×8 芯片划分为 4×2 的 GCell 网格。

5
00:00:32,536 --> 00:00:38,274
Demand estimates routing pressure; capacity is the available supply.
需求估算布线压力，容量是可用供给。

6
00:00:38,274 --> 00:00:42,100
Congestion equals demand divided by capacity.
拥挤度等于需求除以容量。

7
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:50,657
All six cells start in the same GCell.
六个单元最初都位于同一个 GCell。

8
00:00:50,657 --> 00:00:58,675
Demand 7 over capacity 2 gives congestion 3.5.
需求 7 除以容量 2，得到拥挤度 3.5。

9
00:00:58,675 --> 00:01:05,690
The tile has 5 units of overflow.
该网格的溢出量为 5。

10
00:01:06,230 --> 00:01:12,560
For congestion above 1, scale width with the alpha rule.
当拥挤度大于 1 时，用 alpha 规则缩放宽度。

11
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:19,523
w' = w × (1 + 0.5 × (c − 1)).
w' = w × (1 + 0.5 × (c − 1))。

12
00:01:19,523 --> 00:01:25,220
Cells in tiles with c ≤ 1 remain unchanged.
c ≤ 1 的网格中的单元保持不变。

13
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:33,027
Congestion 3.5 creates a width multiplier of 2.25.
拥挤度 3.5 产生 2.25 的宽度倍率。

14
00:01:33,027 --> 00:01:43,927
A–D grow from 2 to 4.5; E–F grow from 1 to 2.25.
A–D 从 2 增至 4.5；E–F 从 1 增至 2.25。

15
00:01:43,927 --> 00:01:47,560
The coordinates remain fixed.
单元坐标保持不变。

16
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:55,367
The placer sees the cell footprint, not only its center.
布局器看到的是单元占地，而不仅是中心点。

17
00:01:55,367 --> 00:02:02,633
Inflated widths push the next placement pass to spread cells.
膨胀后的宽度会推动下一轮布局展开单元。

18
00:02:02,633 --> 00:02:07,720
Inflation is feedback, not the final placement.
膨胀是一种反馈，不是最终布局。

19
00:02:08,260 --> 00:02:14,883
A tile with congestion 0.8 is not hot.
拥挤度为 0.8 的网格不是热点。

20
00:02:14,883 --> 00:02:20,677
Its cell keeps the exact base width.
其中单元保持原始宽度。

21
00:02:20,677 --> 00:02:27,300
Inflating every cell would blur the congestion signal.
让所有单元膨胀会模糊拥挤信号。

22
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:35,203
The spread placement distributes demand across many GCells.
展开布局把需求分散到多个 GCell。

23
00:02:35,203 --> 00:02:42,567
The clustered seed concentrates overflow in one tile.
聚类种子把溢出集中在一个网格。

24
00:02:42,567 --> 00:02:49,930
Always compute inflation from the current congestion state.
必须根据当前拥挤状态重新计算膨胀。

25
00:02:50,470 --> 00:02:56,462
Inflate only cells in hot tiles.
只膨胀热点网格中的单元。

26
00:02:56,462 --> 00:03:04,451
Scale the modeled dimension; this lab uses width.
缩放布局模型使用的维度；本实验使用宽度。

27
00:03:04,451 --> 00:03:12,440
Reset to base widths before another inflation pass.
再次膨胀前必须重置到原始宽度。

28
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:22,385
Run inflation on the clustered seed and inspect the hot tile.
在聚类种子上运行膨胀，并检查热点网格。

29
00:03:22,385 --> 00:03:29,225
Verify widths and confirm that coordinates stay fixed.
核对宽度，并确认坐标保持不变。

30
00:03:29,225 --> 00:03:35,210
Congestion becomes footprint, and footprint guides placement.
拥挤转成占地，占地再引导下一轮布局。
